%% Sequence Diagram for Youth Account Management (Mermaid)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant UI as Parent Dashboard UI
    participant API as Youth Account API
    participant Auth as OAuth Auth Service
    participant DB as Youth Account DB
    participant CoreBanking as Core Banking Service
    participant Payment as Payment Service
    participant Transaction as Transaction Ledger Service

    %% Dashboard access
    Parent->>UI: Login & view dashboard
    UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard [OAuth2]
    API->>Auth: Validate OAuth2 Token & RBAC
    Auth-->>API: Token Valid / Roles Checked
    API->>DB: Fetch youth account, settings, limits
    API->>Transaction: Fetch recent transactions
    API->>CoreBanking: Get account data
    API-->>UI: Dashboard data (balance, limits, transactions)
    UI-->>Parent: Render dashboard

    %% Fund transfer
    Parent->>UI: Initiate fund transfer
    UI->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer [OAuth2]
    API->>Auth: Validate OAuth2 Token & RBAC
    Auth-->>API: Token Valid / Roles Checked
    API->>Payment: Execute fund transfer
    Payment-->>API: Transfer result
    API->>DB: Update balance
    API-->>UI: Transfer confirmation
    UI-->>Parent: Show transfer status

    %% Set spending limit
    Parent->>UI: Update spending limit
    UI->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit [OAuth2]
    API->>Auth: Validate OAuth2 Token & RBAC
    Auth-->>API: Token Valid / Roles Checked
    API->>DB: Update weekly limit
    API-->>UI: Limit update status
    UI-->>Parent: Show updated limit

    %% Transaction history
    Parent->>UI: View transaction history
    UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions [OAuth2]
    API->>Auth: Validate OAuth2 Token & RBAC
    Auth-->>API: Token Valid / Roles Checked
    API->>Transaction: Fetch transactions (with filters)
    API-->>UI: Transaction list
    UI-->>Parent: Show history

    %% Admin auditing (optional)
    Admin->>API: Audit APIs [OAuth2, RBAC]
    API->>DB: Query logs
    API-->>Admin: Audit data